WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.185 --> 00:00:16.272
Ooh! pretty!

2
00:00:17.553 --> 00:00:18.434
Who are you?

3
00:00:20.175 --> 00:00:21.395
I'm a jellyfish.

4
00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.017
We are invertebrate animals.

5
00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:30.040
That means we have no backbone.

6
00:00:31.872 --> 00:00:32.933
Where do you live?

7
00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.794
We live in oceans all over the world.

8
00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:41.656
We like both deep and shallow water.

9
00:00:43.197 --> 00:00:44.938
What do jellyfish eat?

10
00:00:46.658 --> 00:00:49.480
We eat fish, plankton, crabs, and shrimp.

11
00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.301
We use our tentacles to capture prey.

12
00:00:54.722 --> 00:00:56.382
Your tentacles are cool!

13
00:00:57.943 --> 00:00:59.504
Our tentacles have venom.

14
00:01:01.504 --> 00:01:03.205
We use it to sting our enemies!

15
00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:08.967
Yikes! Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:12.109
Sea turtles like to eat us.

17
00:01:14.089 --> 00:01:15.510
Humans can harm us too.

18
00:01:17.171 --> 00:01:18.591
They use us for medicine.

19
00:01:19.972 --> 00:01:21.853
Do you ever sting humans?

20
00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.734
Some jellyfish do sting people.

21
00:01:27.355 --> 00:01:29.216
And their sting can be dangerous.

22
00:01:31.068 --> 00:01:33.309
But most jellyfish leave people alone.

23
00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.590
Do jellyfish swim well?

24
00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:40.432
No. We mostly float in the ocean.

25
00:01:41.532 --> 00:01:42.873
But we can move on our own.

26
00:01:44.494 --> 00:01:45.074
Watch this!

27
00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:52.817
Here comes a wave.

28
00:01:54.138 --> 00:01:56.379
Watch me float away!

29
00:01:57.699 --> 00:01:59.300
Good-bye, Jellyfish!
